== Trivia ==
Broadcasted games as commentator in the mid 2000s together with players like {{Player|Paradoks|flag=dk}}, {{Player|HangTime|flag=uk}}, {{Player|Sassa|flag=se}} and {{Player|Gaz|flag=UK}}. 

Frequently casts big div1 games together with {{Player|Peppe|flag=se}} on https://twitch.tv/peppe_qw and https://twitch.tv/xerialqw. Long-term storage of games are found on https://youtube.com/@xerialqw

Introduced Quakeworld and FPS games to his younger cousin, who grew up to become CS:GO pro Maikelele.

He was a member of the fake nicker clan - Clan Iran - under the pseudonym mehmet, together with players such as {{Player|Javve|flag=se}}, {{Player|Vortex|flag=se}}, {{Player|Sassa|flag=se}} and {{Player|Killis|flag=se}}

